Package: irtpop
Title: Population-Based Item Metrics for Fitted mirt Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Joakim", "Wallmark", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "joakim.wallmark@umu.se")
Description: Computes population difficulty and population discrimination for
    items fitted with the 'mirt' package. These metrics integrate expected item
    scores and their gradients over a specified latent trait distribution,
    providing summary statistics that reflect item behaviour across a population
    rather than at a single trait level. Standard errors via the Delta method are
    available for the multidimensional two-parameter logistic (M2PL) model.
    Methods are described in Wallmark (in preparation).
